    {
      "sentence_id": "s7_C01",
      "text": "Whether AGN feedback dominates quenching is actively debated: AGN feedback is one important axis, but its dominance relative to stellar feedback, gas retention, strangulation, stripping, halo/environment, and satellite channels remains debated and context-dependent.",
      "bound_entry_ids": [
        "clc_agn2299_003_dominance_debate"
