    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s7_D04",
      "text": "On the other side, some local AGN-host central regions show molecular gas fractions about a factor of 2 lower than star-forming regions — a central-kpc scoped result, resting most strongly on four best-statistics galaxies, and not a global quenching claim.",
      "bound_entry_ids": [
